ry: Nation where the match took place\n- League: Specific league competition\n- Season: Playing season for the match\n- HomeTeam: Name of the home team\n- AwayTeam: Name of the away team\n- home_goal: Number of goals scored by the home team\n- away_goal: Number of goals scored by the away team\n- result: Outcome of the match (home team win, away team win, draw)\n\nThis rich resource allows for in-depth analysis of various football trends and statistics across countries, leagues, and seasons."}